B.Ov=s(["Sabittir, yaln\u0131zca kanun de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fiyle artar.","Her takvim y\u0131l\u0131 ba\u015f\u0131nda yeniden de\u011ferleme oran\u0131nda art\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.","H\xe2kim her dava i\xe7in ayr\u0131ca takdir eder.","Taraflar s\xf6zle\u015fmeyle serbest\xe7e belirler."],t.s)
B.Vj=new A.b0("ispat_02",B.cj,"Senetle ispat zorunlulu\u011fundaki parasal s\u0131n\u0131r nas\u0131l belirlenir?",B.Ov,1,"S\u0131n\u0131r her takvim y\u0131l\u0131 ba\u015f\u0131ndan ge\xe7erli olmak \xfczere \xf6nceki y\u0131la ili\u015fkin yeniden de\u011ferleme oran\u0131nda art\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r. G\xfcncel TL tutar\u0131n\u0131 ilgili y\u0131l\u0131n oran\u0131na g\xf6re teyit et.")
B.Oz=s(["Her h\xe2lde tan\u0131kla ispatlanabilir.","Miktar\u0131na bak\u0131lmaks\u0131z\u0131n senetle ispatlanmas\u0131 gerekir; tan\u0131k dinlenemez.","Yaln\u0131zca yeminle ispatlan\u0131r.","Hi\xe7bir \u015fekilde ispatlanamaz."],t.s)
B.VG=new A.b0("ispat_03",B.cj,'Senede ba\u011fl\u0131 bir iddiaya kar\u015f\u0131 ileri s\xfcr\xfclen "senede ayk\u0131r\u0131" bir savunma, s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n alt\u0131nda kalsa bile nas\u0131l ispatlan\u0131r?',B.Oz,1,"HMK m. 201 (senede kar\u015f\u0131 tan\u0131kla ispat yasa\u011f\u0131): Senede ba\u011fl\u0131 her t\xfcr iddiaya kar\u015f\u0131 ileri s\xfcr\xfclen ve senedin h\xfck\xfcm ve kuvvetini ortadan kald\u0131racak/azaltacak iddialar, miktar ne olursa olsun tan\u0131kla ispatlanamaz.")
B.QH=s(["Hi\xe7bir delil kabul edilmez.","Tan\u0131k dinlenebilir.","Dava reddedilir.","Yaln\u0131zca bilirki\u015fi incelemesi yap\u0131l\u0131r."],t.s)
B.Vl=new A.b0("ispat_04",B.cj,'Senetle ispat zorunlulu\u011fu bulunan bir h\xe2lde "delil ba\u015flang\u0131c\u0131" varsa sonu\xe7 ne olur?',B.QH,1,"HMK m. 202: Delil ba\u015flang\u0131c\u0131 varsa tan\u0131k dinlenebilir. Delil ba\u015flang\u0131c\u0131; iddia edilen i\u015flemi tamamen ispata yetmemekle birlikte onu muhtemel g\xf6steren ve aleyhine ileri s\xfcr\xfclen ki\u015fi (veya temsilcisi) taraf\u0131ndan verilmi\u015f yaz\u0131l\u0131 belgedir.")
